aktır. Lütfen önerilen video oynatıcılardan birini, tercihen mpv kullanın: https://mpv.ioDialogue: 0,0:01:31.86,0:01:41.85,Warning,,0,0,0,,Medya oynatıcınız bu bölümde kullanılan altyazı formatını desteklemiyor. Altyazılar muhtemelen düzgün çalışmayacaktır. Lütfen önerilen video oynatıcılardan birini, tercihen mpv kullanın: https://mpv.ioDialogue: 50,0:01:33.53,0:01:37.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sasaki-sama, yakalanacağınız aklımıza gelmezdi.Dialogue: 50,0:01:38.20,0:01:39.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ahmakça, değil mi?Dialogue: 50,0:01:39.87,0:01:43.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Güya en iyi arkadaşım olan Kyoshiro tarafından kandırıldım.Dialogue: 50,0:01:47.96,0:01:49.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ee...Dialogue: 50,0:01:49.09,0:01:50.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,buraya ne oldu böyle?Dialogue: 50,0:01:50.92,0:01:55.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Şey, Big Mom kule içinde saldırınca...Dialogue: 50,0:01:55.18,0:01:57.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Saldırısı, duvarı mı deldi geçti yani?Dialogue: 50,0:01:58.31,0:02:00.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nasıl bir güç böyle.Dialogue: 50,0:02:00.68,0:02:03.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Neyse, sayenizde kurtuldum.Dialogue: 50,0:02:03.94,0:02:08.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ama hâlâ Kyoshiro'nun Oden'in hizmetkârı olduğuna inanamıyorum.Dialogue: 50,0:02:10.65,0:02:14.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wano'nun tarihi ilgimi çekmese de...Dialogue: 50,0:02:15.41,0:02:18.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,bana ihanetinin günahı ağır!Dialogue: 50,0:02:24.87,0:02:26.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Saldırın!Dialogue: 50,0:02:34.09,0:02:36.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu zulme burada bir son vereceğiz!Dialogue: 50,0:02:47.56,0:02:50.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Minklerin kökünü kurutun!Dialogue: 50,0:02:51.15,0:02:52.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Minklerin azmi...Dialogue: 50,0:02:52.94,0:02:55.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,muhakkak siz-garalara üstün gelecektir!Dialogue: 50,0:02:55.15,0:02:57.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yapabiliyorsanız yapın da görelim!Dialogue: 50,0:03:05.37,0:03:07.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bununla bitecek!Dialogue: 50,0:03:25.60,0:03:27.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Öne çıkma vaktidir!Dialogue: 50,0:03:27.77,0:03:28.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bekleyin.Dialogue: 50,0:03:30.15,0:03:31.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kin'emon.Dialogue: 50,0:03:33.86,0:03:35.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Inu, Neko!Dialogue: 50,0:03:36.49,0:03:38.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bunu bize bırakın.Dialogue: 50,0:03:39.28,0:03:40.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Evet.Dialogue: 50,0:04:22.03,0:04:22.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hızlılar!Dialogue: 50,0:04:43.55,0:04:46.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hasır Şapkalar değil yalnızca...Dialogue: 50,0:04:46.64,0:04:50.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,şuradakiler de kesinlikle Udon mahkûmları!Dialogue: 50,0:04:51.06,0:04:53.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hyogoro bile burada!Dialogue: 50,0:04:53.27,0:04:57.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Udon tutsak madeninde neler olmuş böyle?Dialogue: 50,0:04:58.44,0:05:01.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Babanuki bize ihanet mi etti?Dialogue: 50,0:05:01.24,0:05:05.41,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Müdür Babanuki, Udon'dan rapor veriyor.Dialogue: 50,0:05:05.41,0:05:12.04,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Hasır Şapkalı Luffy'yle Kaptan Kid ve bela çıkaran diğer herkes, hücreye tıkıldı.Dialogue: 50,0:05:12.04,0:05:14.84,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Yani burada durum kontrol altında.Dialogue: 50,0:05:16.34,0:05:18.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bir terslik var!Dialogue: 50,0:05:22.18,0:05:24.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Seni şimdi suçlamayacağım.Dialogue: 50,0:05:24.64,0:05:27.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sen eskiden beri beyinsizdin.Dialogue: 50,0:05:27.77,0:05:30.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tek kelimeyle ağzıma sıçtın, adi herif!Dialogue: 50,0:05:31.44,0:05:35.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu durumu bir an önce düzeltmemiz gerek.Dialogue: 50,0:05:35.69,0:05:38.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sonunda lider gibi konuştun!Dialogue: 50,0:05:40.03,0:05:42.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hasır Şapka adisi!Dialogue: 50,0:05:44.74,0:05:48.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Onigashima kaos içinde.Dialogue: 50,0:05:48.29,0:05:49.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hawkins.Dialogue: 50,0:05:49.75,0:05:53.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Canavar Korsanları'na istemeden dahil oldun.Dialogue: 50,0:05:54.04,0:05:56.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,İhanet edeceksen şimdi vaktidir.Dialogue: 50,0:05:56.17,0:05:58.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,İhanet etmem için beni teşvik mi ediyorsun?Dialogue: 50,0:05:59.84,0:06:00.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Aptal değilim.Dialogue: 50,0:06:03.05,0:06:04.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yüzde 1.Dialogue: 50,0:06:05.30,0:06:07.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne öngörmeye çalışıyorsun?Dialogue: 50,0:06:08.26,0:06:11.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Belli bir adamın yarına dek hayatta kalma olasılığını.Dialogue: 50,0:06:12.10,0:06:13.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yüzde 1 mi...?Dialogue: 50,0:06:14.35,0:06:15.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Üzüldüm.Dialogue: 50,0:06:20.19,0:06:22.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Toplanın, Tobi Roppo!Dialogue: 50,0:06:24.53,0:06:26.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sinir bozucu!Dialogue: 50,0:06:26.20,0:06:27.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne var, King?Dialogue: 50,0:06:28.33,0:06:29.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hepinizin...Dialogue: 50,0:06:29.83,0:06:31.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,bildiği gibi...Dialogue: 50,0:06:31.83,0:06:33.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,durumlar değişti.Dialogue: 50,0:06:34.50,0:06:37.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yılda bir kez yapılan Ateş Festivali gününde...Dialogue: 50,0:06:37.00,0:06:41.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...düşmanımız olan Kızıl Kın samuraylarının istilasına engel olamadık.Dialogue: 50,0:06:42.59,0:06:46.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Onigashima tarihindeki en büyük fiyasko bu.Dialogue: 50,0:06:48.72,0:06:53.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kaido-san'ın başlattığı aramızdaki şu çekişmeye son vermeliyiz.Dialogue: 50,0:06:53.85,0:06:55.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Çekişme mi?Dialogue: 50,0:06:55.10,0:06:57.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Genç Efendi Yamato ile ilgili olan.Dialogue: 50,0:06:57.61,0:07:00.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kayıp olan Genç Efendi Yamato'yu bulup getirenin...Dialogue: 50,0:07:01.15,0:07:05.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Önder olabilmek için bize meydan okuma hakkı kazanması meselesi.Dialogue: 50,0:07:06.86,0:07:08.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ben de bunu bekliyordum fakat...Dialogue: 50,0:07:09.28,0:07:11.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...şimdilik ertelememiz gerekiyor.Dialogue: 50,0:07:11.99,0:07:13.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne?! Cidden mi?!Dialogue: 50,0:07:13.62,0:07:14.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Elbette.Dialogue: 50,0:07:15.41,0:07:18.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Etrafına bir bak, abla.Dialogue: 50,0:07:18.29,0:07:21.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Canım Pay-Pay'im! Tam da seni arıyordum!Dialogue: 50,0:07:21.59,0:07:26.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yamato duvara tırmanarak kaçtığı için beni sırtında taşımanı bekliyordum!Dialogue: 50,0:07:26.13,0:07:26.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Asla!Dialogue: 50,0:07:26.80,0:07:27.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Asla mı?Dialogue: 50,0:07:27.72,0:07:29.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kesin sesinizi, adi veletler sizi!Dialogue: 50,0:07:30.47,0:07:31.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Kime velet dedin sen? – Kime velet dedin sen?Dialogue: 50,0:07:31.97,0:07:34.85,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,Ben velet değilim, bana velet deme!Dialogue: 50,0:07:34.23,0:07:36.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kaido-san çatıda.Dialogue: 50,0:07:37.19,0:07:40.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Düşman, içeriden tırmarak yukarıya ulaşmaya çalışacak.Dialogue: 50,0:07:41.61,0:07:45.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Her biriniz, kendi yöntemlerinizle onları engellemelisiniz.Dialogue: 50,0:07:45.90,0:07:48.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bizim 30 bin askerimiz var.Dialogue: 50,0:07:48.41,0:07:51.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,İşgalcilerin sayısı ise 5 bin.Dialogue: 50,0:07:52.33,0:07:55.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ama yine de onları hafife almasanız iyi olur.Dialogue: 50,0:07:55.71,0:07:57.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,İyi şanslar.Dialogue: 50,0:08:03.09,0:08:04.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, Drake!Dialogue: 50,0:08:04.67,0:08:07.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu karmaşa bir fırsat,Dialogue: 50,0:08:07.09,0:08:08.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,bana biraz eşlik et.Dialogue: 50,0:08:08.72,0:08:10.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tek başıma altından kalkamam.Dialogue: 50,0:08:11.89,0:08:13.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nereye gideceksin?Dialogue: 50,0:08:13.22,0:08:15.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Öldürmek istediğim kişiyi öldürmeye.Dialogue: 50,0:08:16.56,0:08:18.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Queen'in yanına.Dialogue: 50,0:08:18.60,0:08:21.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kendi aranızdaki işlere beni bulaştırmayın.Dialogue: 50,0:08:21.69,0:08:23.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Savaş gücümüzü azaltmak mı niyetin?Dialogue: 50,0:08:23.65,0:08:25.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bir işe yaradığı yok zaten.Dialogue: 50,0:08:26.15,0:08:28.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ben öyle demezdim.Dialogue: 50,0:08:30.61,0:08:32.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hasır Şapka ve diğerleri!Dialogue: 50,0:08:32.58,0:08:35.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kaleye giden yolu sizin için temizleyeceğiz!Dialogue: 50,0:08:35.95,0:08:41.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gücünüzü boşa harcayıp da yorulmayın!Dialogue: 50,0:08:47.09,0:08:49.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,İlerleyin!Dialogue: 50,0:08:49.26,0:08:54.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hasır Şapkalar için yolu açın!Dialogue: 50,0:09:08.49,0:09:10.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Heveslerini kırın!Dialogue: 50,0:09:10.36,0:09:12.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Alt tarafı mahkûm ve yakuza onlar!Dialogue: 50,0:09:16.24,0:09:18.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne kargaşa ama.Dialogue: 50,0:09:23.88,0:09:26.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Şu iriyi de indirmemiz lazım!Dialogue: 50,0:09:26.46,0:09:28.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Böyle insanlar da varmış demek.Dialogue: 50,0:09:29.34,0:09:31.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tereddüt yok! Onu indirmeliyiz!Dialogue: 50,0:09:31.72,0:09:33.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ayaklarına saldırın!Dialogue: 50,0:10:06.67,0:10:09.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Amanın, kıl payıydı.Dialogue: 50,0:10:10.67,0:10:11.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Jinbe-san!Dialogue: 50,0:10:43.96,0:10:47.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu kadar yeter!Dialogue: 50,0:10:52.51,0:10:53.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kaido!Dialogue: 50,0:10:54.76,0:10:59.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Jack, bizzat benim seçtiğim bir Önder!Dialogue: 50,0:10:59.26,0:11:05.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Değerli adamım öldürülürken sessiz kalıp izleyecek değilim!Dialogue: 50,0:11:05.48,0:11:08.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Özür... dilerim,Dialogue: 50,0:11:08.86,0:11:10.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kaido-sama...Dialogue: 50,0:11:10.86,0:11:14.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Zayıf olmadığını biliyorum.Dialogue: 50,0:11:15.32,0:11:17.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sadece...Dialogue: 50,0:11:20.16,0:11:22.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,onlar çok güçlü!Dialogue: 50,0:11:27.46,0:11:32.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sulong formları yüzünden ciddi zayiat verdik.Dialogue: 50,0:11:33.01,0:11:38.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ama o Sulong'ları bu noktaya kadar da iyi idare ettin.Dialogue: 50,0:11:38.55,0:11:40.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Git de baktır kendine,Dialogue: 50,0:11:40.43,0:11:42.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,bu kadarı yeterli.Dialogue: 50,0:11:44.48,0:11:46.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne demek oluyor bu?Dialogue: 50,0:11:46.98,0:11:50.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bunu bizim sormamız gerek.Dialogue: 50,0:11:53.40,0:11:58.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Çiçek Başkenti'nde, Trafalgar Law'ı sen serbest bıraktın.Dialogue: 50,0:11:58.53,0:12:00.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oraya bir gardiyan dikmiştik...Dialogue: 50,0:12:00.53,0:12:04.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Senden başkası olamaz, diye düşündüm.Dialogue: 50,0:12:04.29,0:12:06.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Amacın nedir?Dialogue: 50,0:12:06.25,0:12:08.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Anlıyorum,Dialogue: 50,0:12:08.04,0:12:09.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,öldürmek istediğin kişi...Dialogue: 50,0:12:09.88,0:12:12.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sendin işte, adi herif!Dialogue: 50,0:12:12.54,0:12:15.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Aramızda böyle birinin olması bir utanç.Dialogue: 50,0:12:15.84,0:12:17.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Neyin peşindesin?Dialogue: 50,0:12:17.80,0:12:21.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,İçimize sızan sadece sen miydin yoksa başkaları da mı var?Dialogue: 50,0:12:21.43,0:12:23.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Neyin nesisin sen?Dialogue: 50,0:12:27.02,0:12:28.60,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,İşler bu noktaya gelmişken...Dialogue: 50,0:12:28.60,0:12:30.35,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,bahane üretmek nafile.Dialogue: 50,0:12:31.90,0:12:33.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne yazık ki...Dialogue: 50,0:12:34.19,0:12:37.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,beni öldürseniz bile size hiçbir şey anlatmam.Dialogue: 50,0:12:37.44,0:12:39.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Seni öldürmeyeceğiz!Dialogue: 50,0:12:39.95,0:12:43.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,İşkencemle iradeni yerle bir edeceğim!Dialogue: 50,0:12:46.16,0:12:51.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sabırsızlanıyorsun, değil mi Drake?Dialogue: 50,0:12:52.42,0:12:53.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Şu canavar...Dialogue: 50,0:12:56.67,0:12:58.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hasır Şapka-san!Dialogue: 50,0:12:58.13,0:13:00.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...aynı Oars'a benziyor.Dialogue: 50,0:13:00.09,0:13:06.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Onun gibi büyük bir şeyi eskiden anca hep birlikte yenebilmiştik.Dialogue: 50,0:13:08.10,0:13:09.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Şimdi durum farklı!Dialogue: 50,0:13:16.57,0:13:17.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy!Dialogue: 50,0:13:25.20,0:13:27.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dördüncü Vites!Dialogue: 50,0:13:28.16,0:13:30.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sıçrayan Adam!Dialogue: 50,0:13:32.88,0:13:35.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, işte yine!Dialogue: 50,0:13:35.00,0:13:38.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,O formu ile tam bir koruyucu tanrı gibi!Dialogue: 50,0:13:56.27,0:13:57.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Pekâlâ.Dialogue: 50,0:13:57.27,0:13:58.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Heh?!Dialogue: 50,0:13:58.69,0:14:00.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,İşkence istemiyorsun demek?Dialogue: 50,0:14:00.94,0:14:02.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yazık oldu!Dialogue: 50,0:14:04.45,0:14:05.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu...Dialogue: 50,0:14:06.08,0:14:08.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,zahmet verdiğim sizlere...Dialogue: 50,0:14:09.04,0:14:10.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,bir hediyemdir!Dialogue: 50,0:14:12.92,0:14:13.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Siper alın!Dialogue: 50,0:14:20.09,0:14:22.34,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne yapmalıyım, nasıl kaçacağım?Dialogue: 50,0:14:22.93,0:14:24.97,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Artık Denizciler'e geri dönemem!Dialogue: 50,0:14:25.59,0:14:26.30,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Hayır!Dialogue: 50,0:14:26.30,0:14:28.31,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Bunu sonra düşünürüm!Dialogue: 50,0:14:32.68,0:14:35.85,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Hâlâ bir umut var!Dialogue: 50,0:14:38.94,0:14:41.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Lastik-Lastik...Dialogue: 50,0:14:42.44,0:14:43.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Çekil yolumdan...Dialogue: 50,0:14:43.70,0:14:45.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Juki!Dialogue: 50,0:14:47.53,0:14:49.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,X...Dialogue: 50,0:14:51.41,0:14:52.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...Kong...Dialogue: 50,0:14:52.62,0:14:54.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...Silahı!Dialogue: 50,0:14:52.62,0:14:54.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...Calibur!Dialogue: 50,0:15:28.12,0:15:28.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,O adam...Dialogue: 50,0:15:28.82,0:15:30.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tobi Roppo'dan Drake!Dialogue: 50,0:15:30.87,0:15:32.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Neden deve saldırdı?!Dialogue: 50,0:15:37.37,0:15:38.96,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Hâlâ bir umut...Dialogue: 50,0:15:40.63,0:15:41.50,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,var!Dialogue: 50,0:15:49.22,0:15:50.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hay lanet!Dialogue: 50,0:15:50.14,0:15:53.35,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy-san müthiştir!Dialogue: 50,0:15:53.35,0:15:55.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hasır Şapkalı Luffy!Dialogue: 50,0:15:55.68,0:15:58.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bir sebepten, artık tek kişilik bir orduyum!Dialogue: 50,0:16:00.48,0:16:01.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Lütfen...Dialogue: 50,0:16:01.86,0:16:05.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,yanınızda savaşmama izin ver!Dialogue: 50,0:16:06.86,0:16:08.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Heh?!Dialogue: 50,0:16:22.21,0:16:24.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kimin nesi bu adam?Dialogue: 50,0:16:24.67,0:16:26.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yanımızda savaşmak mı?Dialogue: 50,0:16:27.22,0:16:33.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,O herif, geçen Çiçek Başkenti'nde Nami-san'la Robin-chan'ı banyoda gözetleyen sapık!Dialogue: 50,0:16:33.81,0:16:37.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,O herif hakikaten de az önce dinazor gibi bir şeye dönüştü!Dialogue: 50,0:16:37.77,0:16:40.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tobi Roppo elemanlarından biri olmalı.Dialogue: 50,0:16:41.90,0:16:44.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ama garip.Dialogue: 50,0:16:45.44,0:16:47.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne yaptığını sanıyor bu?Dialogue: 50,0:16:47.74,0:16:49.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, Drake!Dialogue: 50,0:16:49.36,0:16:51.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne diye bir Numbers'a saldırdın?Dialogue: 50,0:16:52.12,0:16:54.79,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy-san müthiştir!Dialogue: 50,0:16:56.12,0:16:58.08,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy-san öyle biri ki...Dialogue: 50,0:16:58.08,0:17:00.75,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,arkadaşlarını çok yakınında tutar...Dialogue: 50,0:17:00.75,0:17:04.25,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,ama düşmanları ona ulaşamaz bile!Dialogue: 50,0:17:04.25,0:17:07.88,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy-san böyle biri işte!Dialogue: 50,0:17:08.51,0:17:10.05,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne demek istiyorsun?Dialogue: 50,0:17:10.05,0:17:13.89,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy-san'ın insanları kendine çeken bir aurası var!Dialogue: 50,0:17:18.73,0:17:20.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Seni tanıyorum!Dialogue: 50,0:17:20.60,0:17:22.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sen de mi Kaido'nun peşindesin?!Dialogue: 50,0:17:22.81,0:17:26.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nedenini söyleyemem ama amacımız aynı!Dialogue: 50,0:17:33.95,0:17:37.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Şu noktada boktan bir numara bize sökmez!Dialogue: 50,0:17:37.66,0:17:38.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy!Dialogue: 50,0:17:39.29,0:17:43.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hawkins gibi, o da Kaido'nun astı!Dialogue: 50,0:17:45.17,0:17:48.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ama şu an o konumla işim bitti!Dialogue: 50,0:17:49.55,0:17:51.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bittiği için mi yanımızda olmak istiyorsun?Dialogue: 50,0:17:51.97,0:17:55.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Böyle iki yüzlü birisine güvenir miyiz hiç?Dialogue: 50,0:17:55.35,0:17:58.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy'den uzak dur, X. Drake!Dialogue: 50,0:17:59.60,0:18:03.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Korsanların dünyasında bile ahlak vardır!Dialogue: 50,0:18:27.29,0:18:29.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Pekâlâ, müttefik olabiliriz.Dialogue: 50,0:18:29.25,0:18:30.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Hayatta olmaz! – Hayatta olmaz!Dialogue: 50,0:18:30.42,0:18:33.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kapa' çeneni, Kaptan! Seni ahmak!Dialogue: 50,0:18:38.68,0:18:41.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bir an önce kaleye gidin, Luffy!Dialogue: 50,0:18:41.56,0:18:42.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Olur!Dialogue: 50,0:18:42.98,0:18:44.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Burası sizde!Dialogue: 50,0:18:47.02,0:18:49.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sanji, kalenin içine gidiyoruz!Dialogue: 50,0:18:49.86,0:18:51.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Evet!Dialogue: 50,0:18:51.03,0:18:52.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hasır şapkalı adam...Dialogue: 50,0:18:52.94,0:18:56.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Korsanların ve samurayların patronu oymuş gibi görünüyor.Dialogue: 50,0:18:56.70,0:18:58.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gidelim, abla!Dialogue: 50,0:18:58.83,0:19:01.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu ikisini, Luffy-san'a yaklaştırmayacağız!Dialogue: 50,0:19:01.79,0:19:03.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Evet! – Evet!Dialogue: 50,0:19:03.16,0:19:05.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Çekilin, samuray bozuntuları!Dialogue: 50,0:19:05.54,0:19:08.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sizi beceriksiz soytarılar sizi!Dialogue: 50,0:19:24.64,0:19:27.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kalenin içinde dövüştüğüm ikili bunlar!Dialogue: 50,0:19:27.81,0:19:28.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Şu adam...Dialogue: 50,0:19:34.44,0:19:36.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Çiçek Başkenti'ndeki dinazor!Dialogue: 50,0:19:37.82,0:19:38.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,İyi de...Dialogue: 50,0:19:40.08,0:19:42.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,yanındaki şu tatlış da kim?Dialogue: 50,0:19:45.12,0:19:49.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kaido-san'ı bir daha görebileceğini düşünme sakın...Dialogue: 50,0:19:49.21,0:19:50.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hasır Şapka!Dialogue: 50,0:19:50.88,0:19:53.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ölümcül... Yeşil Yıldız!Dialogue: 50,0:19:58.72,0:20:01.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Patlayan Kurukafa Otu!Dialogue: 50,0:20:08.60,0:20:09.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Pay-Pay!Dialogue: 50,0:20:15.19,0:20:17.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,K-Kim o?Dialogue: 50,0:20:20.78,0:20:22.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ben Nami!Dialogue: 50,0:20:22.49,0:20:24.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sen de kimsin be?Dialogue: 50,0:20:24.87,0:20:27.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kertenkelelerin kökünü kazımaya bayılırım!Dialogue: 50,0:20:27.41,0:20:29.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,O yüzden, hazırla kendini!Dialogue: 50,0:20:30.67,0:20:32.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne yapıyorsun sen be?Dialogue: 50,0:20:33.42,0:20:35.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kertenkele mi dedin?Dialogue: 50,0:20:37.34,0:20:41.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Şimdi üzerine kertenkele ilacı sıkacağım!Dialogue: 50,0:20:41.09,0:20:42.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Saklanmasana be!Dialogue: 50,0:20:43.85,0:20:46.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yapacağınızı yaptınız!Dialogue: 50,0:20:46.27,0:20:49.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kimdi o?Dialogue: 50,0:20:49.64,0:20:51.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, Pay-Pay!Dialogue: 50,0:20:51.27,0:20:53.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Şu kadındı-arinsu!Dialogue: 50,0:20:53.69,0:20:54.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Doğru!Dialogue: 50,0:20:54.73,0:20:58.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Benim adım, Kertenkele Avcısı Nami!Dialogue: 50,0:20:58.49,0:20:59.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Unutmayın bu adı!Dialogue: 50,0:20:59.86,0:21:01.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sus dedim sana!Dialogue: 50,0:21:03.53,0:21:06.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ben değildim ama fark etmez artık!Dialogue: 50,0:21:06.24,0:21:08.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Savaş zaten başlamış durumda!Dialogue: 50,0:21:09.92,0:21:10.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Şimdi...Dialogue: 50,0:21:12.38,0:21:14.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,gelin de görelim!Dialogue: 50,0:21:15.25,0:21:15.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne?!Dialogue: 50,0:21:15.30,0:21:15.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne?!Dialogue: 50,0:21:15.34,0:21:15.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne?!Dialogue: 50,0:21:15.38,0:21:17.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne?!Dialogue: 50,0:21:19.84,0:21:22.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yaptığınla dediğin birbirini tutmuyor!Dialogue: 50,0:21:22.18,0:21:23.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sen hiç konuşma!Dialogue: 50,0:21:23.89,0:21:26.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kaçamayacaksınız!Dialogue: 50,0:21:26.18,0:21:28.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne cüretle Pay-Pay'e...Dialogue: 50,0:21:28.23,0:21:29.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bizim...Dialogue: 50,0:21:29.27,0:21:30.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,kaçmalarımızı...Dialogue: 50,0:21:30.27,0:21:33.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– ...hafife almayın! – ...hafife almayın!Dialogue: 50,0:21:33.15,0:21:35.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Bekleyin! – Bekleyin!Dialogue: 50,0:21:37.11,0:21:40.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Durun! – Durun!Dialogue: 50,0:21:40.78,0:21:42.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sana güveniyorum, Usopp!Dialogue: 50,0:21:42.53,0:21:44.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Canım Nami-san'ımı koru!Dialogue: 50,0:21:44.57,0:21:47.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hadi, Luffy! Kin'emon'ların olduğu yere gidelim!Dialogue: 50,0:21:47.45,0:21:48.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tamam!Dialogue: 50,0:21:55.46,0:21:56.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, Sanji!Dialogue: 50,0:21:56.67,0:21:57.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kulaklarını kapat!Dialogue: 50,0:21:58.96,0:22:00.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,T-Tamam!Dialogue: 50,0:22:00.34,0:22:03.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Savaş müziğime kulak verin!Dialogue: 50,0:22:03.22,0:22:04.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kes!Dialogue: 50,0:22:11.73,0:22:15.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sanki biraz akıllanmışsın, Hasır Şapka!Dialogue: 50,0:22:16.31,0:22:17.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ama...Dialogue: 50,0:22:18.90,0:22:24.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,işitmeden savaşmak biraz zor olacak!Dialogue: 50,0:22:24.16,0:22:25.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kulak ver!Dialogue: 50,0:22:58.61,0:23:00.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Jaki!Dialogue: 50,0:23:04.45,0:23:05.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Goki!Dialogue: 50,0:23:09.95,0:23:11.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Juki!Dialogue: 50,0:23:13.96,0:23:17.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu ne acı verici bir manzara böyle!Dialogue: 50,0:23:17.08,0:23:21.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,S-Siz onunuz...Dialogue: 50,0:23:21.63,0:23:26.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,bir sürü şehri yakıp yıkmamış mıydınız?Dialogue: 50,0:23:29.39,0:23:31.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yani kalkıp...Dialogue: 50,0:23:32.64,0:23:37.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,şu güzelim ziyafette sarhoşken benzetilmek...Dialogue: 50,0:23:37.94,0:23:40.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,size hiç yakışmadı!Dialogue: 50,0:23:50.95,0:23:51.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Değil mi?!Dialogue: 50,0:23:51.66,0:23:55.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Haksız mıyım... Haccha?!Dialogue: 50,0:23:59.92,0:24:03.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,İyice ayıldın mı?Dialogue: 50,0:24:06.47,0:24:08.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bunlardan 10 tane mi varmış?!Dialogue: 50,0:24:08.76,0:24:10.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kolam yetmeyecek!Dialogue: 50,0:24:10.93,0:24:13.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne olursa olsun, her biri bir tehdit!Dialogue: 50,0:24:14.18,0:24:17.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Antik bir dev sahiden kızdığında...Dialogue: 50,0:24:17.81,0:24:22.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,neler olurmuş, göster şunlara!Dialogue: 50,0:24:24.73,0:24:27.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne, onların eğitmeni falan mı bu?Dialogue: 50,0:24:27.40,0:24:29.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Seni adi...Dialogue: 50,0:24:29.03,0:24:30.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Boş ver!Dialogue: 50,0:24:30.03,0:24:31.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gitmemiz gerek!Dialogue: 50,0:24:32.12,0:24:33.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Anladım!Dialogue: 50,0:24:33.41,0:24:34.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gidelim!Dialogue: 50,0:24:34.29,0:24:35.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tabii!Dialogue: 50,0:24:39.42,0:24:43.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Şov zamanı, açın perdeleri!Dialogue: 50,0:24:43.04,0:24:44.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sahnede size yer yok...Dialogue: 50,0:24:44.80,0:24:46.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,bu tek kişilik bir gösteri!Dialogue: 50,0:24:47.63,0:24:49.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Durma, Luffy!Dialogue: 50,0:24:49.05,0:24:50.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Anladım!Dialogue: 50,0:25:17.58,0:25:19.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nasıl bir güçtür bu?!Dialogue: 50,0:25:19.46,0:25:22.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yoldaşını silah olarak mı kullanacak yoksa?Dialogue: 50,0:25:23.33,0:25:24.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Eyvah!Dialogue: 50,0:25:33.80,0:25:38.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Franky, doğruca kubbenin dışına doğru koş!Dialogue: 50,0:25:39.77,0:25:44.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,O şey burada kontrolden çıkarsa samuraylar buna dayanamaz!Dialogue: 50,0:25:44.69,0:25:46.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Anladım!Dialogue: 50,0:25:46.40,0:25:47.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sana güveniyorum!Dialogue: 50,0:25:47.48,0:25:48.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tabii!Dialogue: 50,0:25:53.57,0:25:58.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,General Franky'yi oyuncak falan mı zannediyor bu?Dialogue: 50,0:26:00.58,0:26:04.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yakalanır mıyım sandın?Dialogue: 50,0:26:06.21,0:26:09.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Beni oyuncak sandığına...Dialogue: 50,0:26:09.88,0:26:13.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,pişman edeceğim seni!Dialogue: 50,0:26:14.51,0:26:15.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,En azından...Dialogue: 50,0:26:17.93,0:26:21.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,sizin kazanmanız, benim işime daha çok gelir!Dialogue: 50,0:26:23.48,0:26:24.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu yetmez mi?Dialogue: 50,0:26:31.86,0:26:32.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Anlıyorum.Dialogue: 50,0:26:32.90,0:26:35.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hiç lafı dolandırmıyorsun.Dialogue: 50,0:26:35.45,0:26:36.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ama...Dialogue: 50,0:26:40.12,0:26:43.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,kimliğini hâlâ saklıyorsun!Dialogue: 50,0:26:43.58,0:26:46.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Böyle biriyle sırt sırta savaşamayız!Dialogue: 50,0:26:53.05,0:26:55.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,İyi bir fikir düştü aklıma!Dialogue: 50,0:26:55.59,0:26:57.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Daha fazla Numbers çağıralım hadi!Dialogue: 50,0:26:58.56,0:27:01.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, çocuklar!Dialogue: 50,0:27:01.18,0:27:04.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ayılın ve buraya gelin!Dialogue: 50,0:27:08.23,0:27:10.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kes şu zırvalığı!Dialogue: 50,0:27:08.23,0:27:10.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kes şu zırvalığı!Dialogue: 50,0:27:14.70,0:27:17.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yo, yo! Söylenenleri duydum, Drake!Dialogue: 50,0:27:18.87,0:27:23.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu defa da şu küçük korsan grubunu mu karıştıracaksın?Dialogue: 50,0:27:25.33,0:27:27.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Scratchmen Apoo!Dialogue: 50,0:27:27.96,0:27:30.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu heriften hep nefret etmişimdir!Dialogue: 50,0:27:30.50,0:27:33.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Onun canına okuyacağım ama sizin için değil!Dialogue: 50,0:27:33.72,0:27:36.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne bu? Ortak nokta mı?Dialogue: 50,0:27:37.14,0:27:40.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ben de ondan hoşlanmıyorum.Dialogue: 50,0:27:42.35,0:27:45.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,O zaman birlikte çalışalım!Dialogue: 50,0:27:46.02,0:27:47.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne dedin?!Dialogue: 50,0:28:06.58,0:28:09.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Drake!Dialogue: 50,0:28:14.51,0:28:19.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kaçabileceğini sanma, seni hain!Dialogue: 50,0:28:19.26,0:28:23.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yoksa casus mu demeliyim?Dialogue: 50,0:28:24.64,0:28:28.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yine ucubenin biri, peşine düşmüş gibi.Dialogue: 50,0:28:28.90,0:28:32.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Böyle birine yenileceğimi mi düşündün?Dialogue: 50,0:28:32.07,0:28:33.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Of, of, of...Dialogue: 50,0:28:33.78,0:28:35.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, dayan biraz!Dialogue: 50,0:28:36.90,0:28:38.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Acıyor, kahretsin!Dialogue: 50,0:28:38.82,0:28:40.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,İyi misin,Dialogue: 50,0:28:40.37,0:28:41.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,yaran derin değil!Dialogue: 50,0:29:08.02,0:29:09.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu...Dialogue: 50,0:29:11.52,0:29:12.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yoksa...Dialogue: 50,0:29:13.40,0:29:14.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,bu mermiler...Dialogue: 50,0:29:34.59,0:29:39.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Şimdi, kaçmaktan yorulduğunuz için öleceksiniz!Dialogue: 50,0:29:41.93,0:29:46.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kaç kez savuşturacaksınız, görelim!Dialogue: 50,0:29:51.31,0:29:53.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bunu düşünmedim bile!Dialogue: 50,0:29:54.11,0:29:56.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Patlayan Nefes!Dialogue: 50,0:29:58.32,0:29:59.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tilki Ateşi Stili...Dialogue: 50,0:30:04.03,0:30:06.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Alev Yaran!Dialogue: 50,0:30:34.60,0:30:36.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kaçmak mı?Dialogue: 50,0:30:36.90,0:30:38.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Güldürme bizi!Dialogue: 50,0:30:39.40,0:30:41.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kaçmaktan gına geldi!Dialogue: 50,0:30:42.11,0:30:44.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Saklanmaktan gına geldi!Dialogue: 50,0:30:44.45,0:30:49.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bırak da Oden-sama'nın samurayları olarak can verelim!Dialogue: 50,0:30:51.66,0:30:54.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kelleni de yanımıza alarak elbet!Dialogue: 2,0:01:31.90,0:01:33.53,Title-207+,,0,0,0,,Tek Kişilik OrduDialogue: 1,0:01:31.90,0:01:33.53,Title-207+,,0,0,0,,Tek Kişilik OrduDialogue: 2,0:22:05.38,0:22:05.42,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,KESDialogue: 2,0:22:05.42,0:22:05.47,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,KESDialogue: 2,0:22:05.47,0:22:05.51,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,KESDialogue: 2,0:22:05.51,0:22:05.55,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,KESDialogue: 2,0:22:05.55,0:22:05.59,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,KESDialogue: 2,0:22:05.59,0:22:05.63,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,KESDialogue: 2,0:22:05.63,0:22:05.67,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,KESDialogue: 2,0:22:05.67,0:22:05.72,Captions-207+,,0,0,0